3\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(0))+\\frac{2}{n}[\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx)]_{0}^{\\pi }) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{n\\pi }((-2\\pi +3)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(n\\pi )-3+\\frac{2}{n}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(n\\pi )-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(0))) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{n\\pi }((-2\\pi +3)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(n\\pi )-3).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, since $\\operatorname{cos}⁡(n\\pi )=(-1)^{n},$ we have\n\n$$\n{b}_{n}=-\\frac{2}{n\\pi }((-2\\pi +3)(-1)^{n}-3)=\\frac{2}{n\\pi }((-1)^{n}(2\\pi -3)+3).\n$$" 13194139535611 true] [17592186357506 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357507 13194139535611 true] [17592186357506 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357508 13194139535611 true] [17592186357506 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357509 13194139535611 true] [17592186357506 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357510 13194139535611 true] [17592186357506 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045451 13194139535611 true] [17592186357506 1041 "field-1" 13194139535611 true] [17592186357506 1104 #edb/ref 17592186357508 13194139535611 true] [17592186357506 1110 #uuid "76bf59f8-6ff0-5ad2-8501-a2d1951e11b0" 13194139535611 true] [17592186357507 1034 "\\frac{2}{n\\pi }((-1)^{n}(2\\pi +3)-3)" 13194139535611 true] [17592186357507 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535611 true] [17592186357507 1111 #uuid "7c43f418-2c6e-5bc2-bf4a-e8aa070f1282" 13194139535611 true] [17592186357508 1034 "\\frac{2}{n\\pi }((-1)^{n}(2\\pi -3)+3)" 13194139535611 true] [17592186357508 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535611 true] [17592186357508 1111 #uuid "2e13b837-4381-5713-bc98-972f2fef9780" 13194139535611 true] [17592186357509 1034 "\\frac{2}{n\\pi }((-1)^{n}(-2\\pi -3)-3)" 13194139535611 true] [17592186357509 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535611 true] [17592186357509 1111 #uuid "48c85509-281d-55f3-8b3d-65a7049dbbca" 13194139535611 true] [17592186357510 1034 "\\frac{6(1-(-1)^{n})}{\\pi n}" 13194139535611 true] [17592186357510 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535611 true] [17592186357510 1111 #uuid "0e3ed4d9-7ce7-56b6-8e38-2955ce72a53d" 13194139535611 true] [17592186357511 1017 #